crowi/docker-elasticsearch
==========================

This image is a community-built, self-host-oriented redistribution of
Elasticsearch with Japanese text-analysis plugins (and, for the `-sudachi`
variant, a Sudachi dictionary) baked in, published by the Crowi project for use
with @crowi/plugin-search-elasticsearch.

It is NOT an official Elastic product and is NOT endorsed by, affiliated with,
or certified by Elasticsearch B.V. "Elasticsearch" is used here descriptively
(nominative use) to identify the bundled upstream software.

This NOTICE file aggregates the attribution / license notices of the bundled
components. The upstream LICENSE.txt / NOTICE.txt of Elasticsearch are retained
in the image (under /usr/share/elasticsearch/) and MUST NOT be removed.

This is not legal advice. Operators redistributing or operating this image are
responsible for confirming compliance with each component's license.


