2. analysis-kuromoji (Elastic plugin — both variants)
-----------------------------------------------------
The Japanese (kuromoji) Analysis plugin is distributed by Elastic alongside
Elasticsearch and is covered by the same Elasticsearch license terms as the
base image (section 1). It is installed via
`bin/elasticsearch-plugin install analysis-kuromoji`.


